meson: allow DRI (needed by EGL) with zink on darwin

Mesa 25.1 only allows EGL with DRI, and DRI only with KMS/DRM or
DRI-GLX (X11), neither of which exists on iOS. Enable DRI when zink is
built for darwin, as Mesa 26 does.

Upstream: backport of the Mesa 26 condition
(with_gallium_zink and host_machine.system() == 'darwin').

--- a/meson.build	2025-08-27 18:58:02
+++ b/meson.build	2026-09-30 07:56:03
@@ -295,7 +295,7 @@
 ].contains(true)
 
 with_dri = false
-if with_gallium and system_has_kms_drm
+if with_gallium and (system_has_kms_drm or (with_gallium_zink and host_machine.system() == 'darwin'))
   _glx = get_option('glx')
   _egl = get_option('egl')
   if _glx == 'dri' or _egl.enabled() or (_glx == 'disabled' and _egl.allowed())
